  "description": "Server-side execution of the CanopyX remote grid protocol: typed request parsing with safety limits, column allow-lists, IQueryable translation (EF Core, LINQ to objects, any LINQ provider), value lists, multi-level grouping and aggregates, streamed CSV export, a provider interface for raw SQL back ends, and commits of edited rows through a writer with server-side validation and conflict detection.",
